#### caught_keeps_values_and_contains_crashes (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> gleam\n\n:= settled (r : result i32 string) : i32 =\n    ?= r ?|\n    | Ok x => x\n    | Error _ => 0i32\n:= ~n = 5i32\n(caught (\\ () => n) |> settled, caught (\\ () => failwith \"boom\" : i32) |> settled, caught (\\ () => n + 1i32) |> settled)\n|> _assert_eq (5i32, 0i32, 6i32)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> gleam

  := settled (r : result i32 string) : i32 =
      ?= r ?|
      | Ok x => x
      | Error _ => 0i32
  := ~n = 5i32
  (caught (\ () => n) |> settled, caught (\ () => failwith "boom" : i32) |> settled, caught (\ () => n + 1i32) |> settled)
  |> _assert_eq (5i32, 0i32, 6i32)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

